<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background: #ff0000; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
      .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #eee; }
      .footer { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; background: #ff0000; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Thanks for reaching out!</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <%= @contact.name %>,</p>

        <p>I've received your message about your project and really appreciate you taking the time to share the details.</p>

        <p><strong>What's next?</strong></p>
        <p>I typically respond to all inquiries within 24 hours. I'll review your project requirements and get back to you with my thoughts and next steps.</p>

        <p><strong>Quick Links:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://example.com">Check out my portfolio</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourprofile">Connect on LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://calendly.com/yourprofile">Schedule a 15-min call</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p>Looking forward to collaborating with you!</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>Your Name</strong><br>
        Ruby on Rails Developer<br>
        Website: www.example.com</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2026 Your Name. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
